key,           title,                features,                         sort, doc
issue_tracker, "Issue tracker",      `["tracker"]`,                    10,   "Tasks moved through a status flow, with inbox, grid, kanban, approvals and due-date filters."
help_desk,     "Help desk",          `["helpdesk", "conversations"]`,  20,   "Support tickets (New → Open → Waiting on customer → Solved) with email conversations: mail to a support address becomes tickets."
shared_inbox,  "Shared inbox",       `["conversations"]`,              25,   "Email threads on their own, for a team to answer, attach to tasks later, or not."
content,       "Content management", `["tracker", "publishing"]`,      30,   "Everything in the issue tracker, plus pages you review and publish to portals."
